msgid "* {{< gd-icon PackedScene >}}`PackedScene`'s `instance()` function has been renamed to `instantiate()`."
msgstr "* {{< gd-icon PackedScene >}}`PackedScene` の `instance()` 関数は `instantiate()` に改名されました"

