#: 3D/interpolated_camera.md
msgid ""
"* `lerp_speed` - the camera's movement speed. Lower values result in a \"lazier\" camera.\n"
"* `target` - choose the camera's target node.\n"
"* `offset` - position of the camera relative to the target."
msgstr ""
"* `lerp_speed` - カメラの移動速度。値を小さくすると「動きが鈍い」印象になります\n"
"* `target` - カメラのターゲットノードを選択します\n"
"* `offset` - ターゲットに対するカメラの相対位置設定です"

#: 3D/interpolated_camera.md
msgid ""
"{{% notice info %}}\n"
"Godot's built-in `InterpolatedCamera` node is deprecated and will be removed in the release of Godot 4.0.\n"
