msgid "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/3d_car_11.png)"
msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/3d_car_11.png)"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "For both, set the **Cast To** to (0, -0.25, 0) and don't forget to check the \"Enabled\" box."
msgstr "両方の場合、［キャスト先］を（0、-0.25、0）に設定し、「有効」ボックスのチェックを忘れずに行ってください。"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "Your [Kinematic Car](/godot_recipes/3.x/3d/kinematic_car/car_base/) climbs slopes, but it doesn't look quite right:"
msgstr "[キネマティックカー](/godot_recipes/3.x/3d/kinematic_car/car_base/) は斜面を登れるようになりましたが、見た目が少し不自然です："

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid ""
"- [Kinematic Car: Base](/godot_recipes/3.x/3d/kinematic_car/car_base/)\n"
"- [KinematicBody: Align with Surface](/godot_recipes/3.x/3d/3d_align_surface/)"
msgstr ""
"## KinematicCar：ベースモデル\n"
"[KinematicCar：基本モデル](/godot_recipes/3.x/3d/kinematic_car/car_base/)\n"
"\n"
"## KinematBody：表面との整列方法\n"
"[KinematicBody：表面との整列テクニック](/godot_recipes/3.x/3d/3d_align_surface/)"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "When neither wheel is on the ground, we don't rotate the car at all."
msgstr "どちらの車輪も地面に接していない場合、車はまったく回転しません。"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "Otherwise, we're going to use an average of the front and rear rays' results. When the ray is colliding, the collider's surface normal is used. This way, if the two wheels are touching different slopes (like on a curved hill, for example), the result will be to try and get both wheels on the surface, like so:"
msgstr "それ以外の場合は、前面および背面レイの結果を平均化して使用します。衝突が発生している場合、衝突オブジェクトの表面法線が考慮されます。この方法により、例えばカーブした坂道のように2つの車輪が異なる斜面に接している状況でも、両方の車輪を可能な限り表面に接触させようとする処理が行われます。"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "### Aligning a 3D object"
msgstr "### 3Dオブジェクトの整列方法"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "3D Kinematic Car: Slopes & Ramps"
msgstr "3Dで自動車を作ろう：傾斜面＆スロープ"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "Now, in the `_physics_process()` function, right after calling `move_and_slide_with_snap()`, we'll check to see if we need to align the car:"
msgstr "`_physics_process()` 関数内で `move_and_slide_with_snap()` を呼び出した直後に、車両を整列させる必要があるかどうかをチェックします。"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "If the ray is not hitting anything, then we'll assume a horizontal surface. That will bring the front or rear down when the other wheel is touching."
msgstr "レイが何も検出しない場合は、水平な面と仮定します。これにより、一方のホイールが接触している場合にもう一方の車輪が下がります。"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "To begin, we need to detect when the wheel isn't on the ground. Add two {{< gd-icon RayCast3D >}}`RayCast` nodes to the car and align them with the front and rear wheels like so:"
msgstr "To begin, we need to detect when the wheel isn't on the ground. Add two {{< gd-icon RayCast3D >}}`RayCast` nodes to the car and align them with the front and rear wheels like so:"

#: 3D/kinematic_car/car_slopes.md
msgid "Kinematic bodies don't automatically rotate on collision. When the wheels aren't both touching the ground, as in the image above, we'll need to align the car manually."
msgstr "運動体は衝突時に自動で回転しません。画像のように車輪が地面に接触していない場合、手動で車を整列させる必要があります。"

