msgstr "スクリプトをエリアに追加し、その `body_entered` シグナルに接続します。このシグナルを使ってコインを削除します。"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_04.md
msgid ""
"To begin, let's set up some collision layers so that we can more easily control\n"
"what objects the areas can interact with. Open the Project Settings and find\n"
"the \"Layer Names/3D Physics\" section. Name the first three layers \"environment\",\n"
"\"player\", and \"pickups\"."
msgstr "まず、衝突判定用のレイヤーを設定して、エリアがどのオブジェクトと相互作用できるかを管理しやすくしましょう。プロジェクト設定を開き、「レイヤー名／3D物理」セクションに移動してください。最初の3つのレイヤーには「環境」「プレイヤー」「収集アイテム」という名前を付けます。"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_04.md
msgid ""
"{{< highlight gdscript>}}\n"
"    if !can_move:\n"
"        return\n"
"{{< /highlight >}}"
msgstr ""
"{{< highlight gdscript>}}\n"
"    if !can_move:\n"
"        return\n"
"{{< /highlight >}}"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_04.md
msgid ""
"Make a new scene with an Area root, and name it \"Bullet\". Add a `MeshInstance`,\n"
"a `CollisionShape`, and a `Timer`. I'm using a sphere shape for the mesh and\n"
"collision, scaled to a radius of `0.2` so that it won't be too big compared\n"
"with the character. The `Timer` is to give the bullet a time limit. Set its\n"
"_One Shot_ and _Autostart_ properties both on."
msgstr ""
"Make a new scene with an Area root, and name it \"Bullet\". Add a `MeshInstance`,\n"
"a `CollisionShape`, and a `Timer`. I'm using a sphere shape for the mesh and\n"
"collision, scaled to a radius of `0.2` so that it won't be too big compared\n"
"with the character. The `Timer` is to give the bullet a time limit. Set its\n"
"_One Shot_ and _Autostart_ properties both on."

