msgid "By itself, a {{< gd-icon Path2D >}}`Path2D` doesn't have much functionality. In order to move along the path, you need to use a {{< gd-icon PathFollow2D >}}`PathFollow2D` node as well. This is a node whose function is to move along a parent {{< gd-icon Path2D >}}`Path2D`."
msgstr "単体では{{< gd-icon Path2D >}} `Path2D`ノードにはほとんど機能がありません。経路に沿って移動するには、{{< gd-icon PathFollow2D >}} `PathFollow2D` ノードも併せて使用が必要です。これは親の {{< gd-icon Path2D >}} `Path2D` に沿って移動する役割を持つノードです。"

