msgstr "RayCast2D"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "Consider a platformer enemy that walks on platforms, but you don't want it to fall off the edges. Add two downward-pointing raycasts to the mob like so:"
msgstr "以下の方法でmobに下向きレイキャストを2つ追加してください。"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid "Here's a player sprite with a raycast attached to the end of the gun. The `target_position` is set to `(250, 0)`."
msgstr "ここに、銃の先端にレイキャストが取り付けられたプレイヤースプライトがあります。`target_position`は`(250, 0)`に設定されています。"

#: kyn/raycast2d.md
