msgid "### The System"
msgstr "#### システム"

#: physics/collision_layers.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "### Accessing via Code"
msgstr "### ノードの選択方法"

#: physics/collision_layers.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "### Example Configuration"
msgstr "### サンプルプロジェクト例"

