msgstr "![alt](/godot_recipes/4.x/img/springjoint_example.gif)"

#: physics/joints_2d.md
msgid "<!-- You can download an example project to play with these joints here: [physics_joints.zip](/godot_recipes/3.x/files/physics_joints.zip) -->"
msgstr "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/GodotRecipes/PhysicsJointsExample/archive/refs/heads/main.zip\">[物理ジョイントサンプルプロジェクト]</a>をダウンロードできます。 [physics_joints.zip](https://github.com/GodotRecipes/PhysicsJointsExample/archive/refs/heads/main.zip)）"

