msgid ""
"{{% notice note %}}\n"
"Note that we've put `ViewportContainer1` second in the {{< gd-icon HBoxContainer >}}`HBoxContainer`. This will\n"
"place it on the right side since Player 1 uses the arrow keys.\n"
"{{% /notice %}}"
msgstr ""
"{{% notice note %}}\n"
"注意点：`ViewportContainer1`を{{< gd-icon HBoxContainer >}}`HBoxContainer`内で2番目に配置しました。この設定により、プレイヤー1が矢印キーを使用するため、コンテナは右側に表示されます。\n"
"{{% /notice %}}"

#: 2D/splitscreen_demo.md
msgid ""
"func _ready():\n"
"    viewport2.world_2d = viewport1.world_2d\n"
"{{< /highlight >}}"
msgstr ""
"viewport2.world_2d = viewport1.world_2d\n"
"{{< /highlight >}}"

